00 ease-out h-[6px] w-[6px]"></div></div></div><div class="absolute mt-12 border-l-2 border-gray-600 pt-9 pl-[24px]" style="left:35%"><div class=""><div class="mb-4 text-sm font-light tracking-wide text-gray-400 md:text-base">20 Aug</div><h2 class="mb-4 text-xl font-medium tracking-wide text-white md:text-xl">GLM-130B</h2><div class="space-y-4"><p class="text-[16px] leading-[28px] tracking-wide text-white opacity-40">Released and open-sourced the 100-billion parameter model GLM-130B.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="h-full w-[200px]"><div class="relative mb-8 px-4 md:mb-12 md:px-0"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute top-[96px] right-4 left-4 h-px -translate-y-1/2 transform bg-gray-600 md:top-[104px] md:right-0 md:left-0"></div></div></div></div><div class="block px-4 py-8 md:hidden"><div class="relative"><div class="absolute top-0 bottom-0 left-8 w-px bg-gray-600"></div><div class="space-y-12"><div class="relative"><div class="absolute top-0 left-8 -translate-x-1/2 transform"><div class="flex h-[16px] w-[16px] items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-blue-400 bg-black"><div class="h-[6px] w-[6px] rounded-full bg-blue-400"></div></div></div><div class="ml-16"><div class="mb-2 text-lg font-medium text-gray-400">2019</div><div class="mb-3 text-sm font-light tracking-wide text-gray-400">15 Mar</div><h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-medium tracking-wide text-white">ZhipuAI Founded</h3><p class="text-sm leading-6 tracking-wide text-white opacity-40">ZhipuAI was founded, originating from Tsinghua University&#x27;s technological achievements.</p></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="absolute top-0 left-8 -translate-x-1/2 transform"><div class="flex h-[16px] w-[16px] items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-blue-400 bg-black"><div class="h-[6px] w-[6px] rounded-full bg-blue-400"></div></div></div><div class="ml-16"><div class="mb-2 text-lg font-medium text-gray-400">2021</div><div class="mb-3 text-sm font-light tracking-wide text-gray-400">10 Mar</div><h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-medium tracking-wide text-white">GLM</h3><p class="text-sm leading-6 tracking-wide text-white opacity-40">Released GLM, a new training paradigm that breaks through the bottlenecks of BERT and GPT.</p></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="absolute top-0 left-8 -translate-x-1/2 transform"><div class="flex h-[16px] w-[16px] items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-blue-400 bg-black"><div class="h-[6px] w-[6px] rounded-full bg-blue-400"></div></div></div><div class="ml-16"><div class="mb-2 text-lg font-medium text-gray-400">2022</div><div class="mb-3 text-sm font-light tracking-wide text-gray-400">20 Aug</div><h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-medium tracking-wide text-white">GLM-130B</h3><p class="text-sm leading-6 tracking-wide text-white opacity-40">Released and open-sourced the 100-billion parameter model GLM-130B.</p></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="absolute top-0 left-8 -translate-x-1/2 transform"><div class="flex h-[16px] w-[16px] items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-blue-400 bg-black"><div class="h-[6px] w-[6px] rounded-full bg-blue-400"></div></div></div><div class="ml-16"><div class="mb-2 text-lg font-medium text-gray-400">2023</div><div class="mb-3 text-sm font-light tracking-wide text-gray-400">15 Mar</div><h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-medium tracking-wide text-white">ChatGLM</h3><p class="text-sm leading-6 tracking-wide text-white opacity-40">Released ChatGLM, a 100-billion parameter conversational model. Its open-source version ChatGLM-6B has been downloaded over 20 million times globally.</p></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="absolute top-0 left-8 -translate-x-1/2 transform"><div class="flex h-[16px] w-[16px] items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-blue-400 bg-black"><div class="h-[6px] w-[6px] rounded-full bg-blue-400"></div></div></div><div class="ml-16"><div class="mb-3 text-sm font-light tracking-wide text-gray-400">10 Aug</div><h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-medium tracking-wide text-white">ZhipuAI ChatGLM</h3><p class="text-sm leading-6 tracking-wide text-white opacity-40">ZhipuAI ChatGLM, one of China&#x27;s first registered large model products, officially launched.</p></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="absolute top-0 left-8 -translate-x-1/2 transform"><div class="flex h-[16px] w-[16px] items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-blue-400 bg-black"><div class="h-[6px] w-[6px] rounded-full bg-blue-400"></div></div></div><div class="ml-16"><div class="mb-2 text-lg font-medium text-gray-400">2024</div><div class="mb-3 text-sm font-light tracking-wide text-gray-400">25 Jan</div><h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-medium tracking-wide text-white">GLM-4</h3><p class="text-sm leading-6 tracking-wide text-white opacity-40">Released the foundation model GLM-4.</p></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="absolute top-0 left-8 -translate-x-1/2 transform"><div class="flex h-[16px] w-[16px] items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-blue-400 bg-black"><div class="h-[6px] w-[6px] rounded-full bg-blue-400"></div></div></div><div class="ml-16"><div class="mb-3 text-sm font-light tracking-wide text-gray-400">18 Jun</div><h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-medium tracking-wide text-white">GLM-4-9B</h3><p class="text-sm leading-6 tracking-wide text-white opacity-40">Released and open-sourced GLM-4-9B and GLM-4V-9B.</p></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="absolute top-0 left-8 -translate-x-1/2 transform"><div class="flex h-[16px] w-[16px] items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-blue-400 bg-black"><div class="h-[6px] w-[6px] rounded-full bg-blue-400"></div></div></div><div class="ml-16"><div class="mb-3 text-sm font-light tracking-wide text-gray-400">12 Aug</div><h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-medium tracking-wide text-white">GLM-4-Plus</h3><p class="text-sm leading-6 tracking-wide text-white opacity-40">Released the new generation foundation large model GLM-4-Plus. ChatGLM launched China&#x27;s first AI video call feature.</p></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="absolute top-0 left-8 -translate-x-1/2 transform"><div class="flex h-[16px] w-[16px] items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-blue-400 bg-black"><div class="h-[6px] w-[6px] rounded-full bg-blue-400"></div></div></div><div class="ml-16"><div class="mb-3 text-sm font-light tracking-wide text-gray-400">28 Oct</div><h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-medium tracking-wide text-white">GLM-4-Voice</h3><p class="text-sm leading-6 tracking-wide text-white opacity-40">Released the emotional voice model GLM-4-Voice and AutoGLM.</p></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="absolute top-0 left-8 -translate-x-1/2 transform"><div class="flex h-[16px] w-[16px] items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-blue-400 bg-black"><div class="h-[6px] w-[6px] rounded-full bg-blue-400"></div></div></div><div class="ml-16"><div class="mb-3 text-sm font-light tracking-wide text-gray-400">15 Nov</div><h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-medium tracking-wide text-white">GLM-PC</h3><p class="text-sm leading-6 tracking-wide text-white opacity-40">Launched GLM-PC, initiating technical exploration of &quot;autonomous&quot; PC.</p></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="absolute top-0 left-8 -translate-x-1/2 transform"><div class="flex h-[16px] w-[16px] items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-blue-400 bg-black"><div class="h-[6px] w-[6px] rounded-full bg-blue-400"></div></div></div><div class="ml-16"><div class="mb-3 text-sm font-light tracking-wide text-gray-400">20 Dec</div><h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-medium tracking-wide text-white">GLM-Zero-Preview</h3><p class="text-sm leading-6 tracking-wide text-white opacity-40">Released the first generation reasoning model GLM-Zero-Preview.</p></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="absolute top-0 left-8 -translate-x-1/2 transform"><div class="flex h-[16px] w-[16px] items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-blue-400 bg-black"><div class="h-[6px] w-[6px] rounded-full bg-blue-400"></div></div></div><div class="ml-16"><div class="mb-2 text-lg font-medium text-gray-400">2025</div><div class="mb-3 text-sm font-light tracking-wide text-gray-400">08 Jan</div><h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-medium tracking-wide text-white">GLM-Realtime</h3><p class="text-sm leading-6 tracking-wide text-white opacity-40">Released the brand-new end-to-end model GLM-Realtime, supporting a cappella singing, 2-minute memory, and Function Call capabilities.</p></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="absolute top-0 left-8 -translate-x-1/2 transform"><div class="flex h-[16px] w-[16px] items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-blue-400 bg-black"><div class="h-[6px] w-[6px] rounded-full bg-blue-400"></div></div></div><div class="ml-16"><div class="mb-3 text-sm font-light tracking-wide text-gray-400">22 Mar</div><h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-medium tracking-wide text-white">AutoGLM Reflection</h3><p class="text-sm leading-6 tracking-wide text-white opacity-40">Released the first AI Agent with deep research and operational capabilities, AutoGLM Reflection.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class="relative mx-auto box-border w-full bg-[#09090A] px-[24px] pt-[42px] pb-[120px]"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[var(--page-container-width)]"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-[60px] md:grid-cols-5"><div class="md:col-span-1"><div><div class="mb-4 text-2xl font-semibold" style="background:linear-gradient(104.66deg, #FFFFFF -40.96%, #A0A5B3 88.68%);background-clip:text;-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;display:inline-block">Z.ai</div></div></div><div class="space-y-[24px]"><h3 class="footer-title">Product</h3><ul class="space-y-[24px]"><li><a href="https://docs.z.ai/guides/llm/glm-5.1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="footer-subtitle">Language Models</a></li><li><a